  "description": "Chan-Woo's neighbors are all nervous when a scary wolf named Eun-Jae moves into their villa. Being a friendly big dog, Chan-Woo tries to be a good neighbor to the cold and gruff wolf, even giving him cream puffs from his favorite bakery. But when Eun-Jae goes into heat for the first time, Chan-Woo's about to get stuffed with a different kind of cream for trying too hard to help...!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
